<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on Ascom.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Ascom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 250,000 American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Ascom, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,500 CHF		 ISSUE PRICE  26.7 CHF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   10.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	04.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,156 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
